   "text": "There are also multidevice experiences, such as continuous media controls and\nauthentication, that could prompt discovering devices and passing data between\nparticipants. For these use cases, we have existing frameworks and SDKs that\nmight be a better fit:",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
