    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 227,
   "text": "Cast SDK for media casting to other\ndevices.\nMedia sessions\nfor continuous playback.\nBlock Store for\nauthentication.\nCompanion Device Manager\nfor discovering and pairing companion devices such as fitness trackers or\nheadphones.",
   "counts": {
    "links": 4,
